   "source": [
    "## Precision-recall curve\n",
    "- the drawback of ROC is that it uses TN, not good for imbalanced problems.\n",
    "\n",
    "    TPR = TP / (TP + FN)\\\n",
    "    FPR = FP / (FP + **TN**)\\\n",
    "    threshold t → TPR, FPR\n",
    "\n",
    "- the precision-recall curve doesn't use TN, ideal **for imbalanced problems.**\n",
    "\n",
    "    precision = TP / (TP + FP)\\\n",
    "    recall = TP / (TP + FN)\\\n",
    "    threshold t → precision, recall\n",
    "\n",
    "    PR本质上在做threshold sweeping，和ROC一样对所有的threshold都run一遍。\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Target: maximize F1 score"
   ]
  },
