      "log_loss(y_true, y_pred, *, normalize=True, sample_weight=None, labels=None)\n",
      "    Log loss, aka logistic loss or cross-entropy loss.\n",
      "\n",
      "    This is the loss function used in (multinomial) logistic regression\n",
