      "    For a single sample with true label :math:`y \\in \\{0,1\\}` and\n",
      "    a probability estimate :math:`p = \\operatorname{Pr}(y = 1)`, the log\n",
      "    loss is:\n",
      "\n",
      "    .. math::\n",
      "        L_{\\log}(y, p) = -(y \\log (p) + (1 - y) \\log (1 - p))\n",
